WEBVTT

00:37.245 --> 00:39.664
What an insane thing to do!

00:39.748 --> 00:43.043
Is killing and bringing one
back to life entertaining to watch?

00:43.126 --> 00:45.003
We cannot even intervene

00:45.086 --> 00:47.797
because Mu-deok foolishly agreed to it.

00:49.090 --> 00:50.300
That girl…

00:52.761 --> 00:54.053
smiled.

00:54.137 --> 00:56.681
Yes. I will try it.

01:01.603 --> 01:03.396
She only said yes

01:03.480 --> 01:06.316
because of the gold she would be getting.

01:06.900 --> 01:09.110
Could gold really be the reason…

01:11.529 --> 01:13.615
why she smiled?

01:25.710 --> 01:27.962
I am not happy
about this situation either.

01:29.047 --> 01:31.299
I will make sure you die a painless death.

01:31.382 --> 01:33.802
This is not to see me die.

01:34.886 --> 01:37.055
It is to see me come back to life.

01:39.307 --> 01:43.645
They will try to buy time with that book
and look for a way to expose you.

01:44.229 --> 01:46.731
When she dies
and the ice stone's power is summoned,

01:46.815 --> 01:50.443
use the ice stone's power
to shift your soul into that girl's body.

01:50.527 --> 01:54.197
The Unanimous Assembly will come
to an end once the Queen dies.

01:55.115 --> 01:59.035
We will safely leave Songrim
with the ice stone.

02:01.788 --> 02:05.375
I wonder why His Majesty
chose her of all people.

02:05.458 --> 02:08.253
She is the weakest one among us.

02:08.336 --> 02:09.963
He picked the right person.

03:18.114 --> 03:19.324
You look beautiful.

03:20.575 --> 03:22.368
My Bu-yeon.

03:31.210 --> 03:32.337
Mother.

04:02.492 --> 04:04.869
No one is looking at you right now.

04:04.953 --> 04:06.704
Use that power to shift souls.

04:07.538 --> 04:09.082
It is not me.

04:09.165 --> 04:12.001
I am not the one controlling
the ice stone.

04:12.585 --> 04:13.753
Then who?

05:00.341 --> 05:01.634
You need to stop that.

05:13.396 --> 05:15.815
Mother, are you all right?

05:20.028 --> 05:21.112
Bu-yeon.

05:25.158 --> 05:27.702
Did she recognize her? This is not good.

05:28.286 --> 05:30.204
They are going to bring her back to life.

05:30.788 --> 05:32.123
That cannot happen.

05:32.206 --> 05:33.541
She needs to die.

06:19.087 --> 06:20.338
What is going on?

06:20.838 --> 06:22.590
Where is the ice stone?

06:26.469 --> 06:27.595
What just happened?

06:40.316 --> 06:41.567
Did you see that?

06:41.651 --> 06:44.821
The power of the ice stone
and the power of the sky came together.

06:44.904 --> 06:47.990
The heavens must have taken the ice stone
and made it disappear.

06:49.075 --> 06:50.618
It did not disappear.

06:55.289 --> 06:56.457
It is

06:57.416 --> 06:58.501
still here.

06:58.584 --> 07:02.505
Where exactly is it?

07:28.030 --> 07:32.243
Lightning, thunder, and now fog
in broad daylight?

07:32.326 --> 07:33.953
That is not all.

07:34.036 --> 07:35.413
Something has gone awry.

07:42.712 --> 07:45.339
- The cloth covering the ice stone, right?
- Yes.

07:45.423 --> 07:46.591
Could something have happened to it?

07:48.009 --> 07:49.469
Is this a dream or something?

07:49.552 --> 07:52.638
- There are flowers everywhere.
- This feels surreal.

07:53.347 --> 07:55.349
Are we dead?

07:55.975 --> 07:58.436
- Are we in utopia?
- Hey.

07:58.519 --> 08:00.146
Do not speak nonsense.

08:00.229 --> 08:03.065
Then would that make me the Jade Emperor,
and him a fairy?

08:04.942 --> 08:06.360
A fairy.

08:16.329 --> 08:17.622
What is that?

08:18.498 --> 08:19.957
I do not think it is a fairy.

08:20.833 --> 08:22.001
Then is it a ghost?

08:31.135 --> 08:33.679
Are you mages?

08:34.388 --> 08:36.641
Yes, we are from Jeongjingak.

08:40.645 --> 08:42.021
You were here too, Young Lady Heo.

08:46.317 --> 08:47.568
Please let go of me.

08:50.530 --> 08:53.783
Jang Uk, remain here and stand guard.

08:54.492 --> 08:55.826
You three.

08:56.619 --> 08:57.620
Patrol the area.

08:57.703 --> 09:01.374
- I will head to the Training Center.
- Your Royal Highness, we will escort you.

09:04.126 --> 09:05.878
What is going on?

09:05.962 --> 09:07.213
I heard deafening thunder.

09:07.296 --> 09:09.423
We do not know yet either.

09:10.216 --> 09:13.219
We will find out soon once this fog lifts.

09:13.886 --> 09:15.638
If we are not in utopia or the afterlife,

09:16.222 --> 09:18.099
where did all these flowers come from?

09:19.183 --> 09:20.768
Is this even a real fog?

09:56.721 --> 09:58.180
What are you doing?

09:58.264 --> 09:59.181
We do not know what happened.

09:59.265 --> 10:02.727
The moment we reached the gate,
a strong gust of wind hit us.

10:02.810 --> 10:03.936
Wind?

10:05.313 --> 10:06.564
There is no wind.

10:10.234 --> 10:12.486
Do not go there. We cannot see it,

10:12.570 --> 10:14.447
but there is great energy blocking us.

10:14.530 --> 10:16.782
What in the world is going on?

10:16.866 --> 10:17.825
It is a barrier.

10:19.243 --> 10:21.954
I believe there is a barrier
around Jeongjingak.

10:22.955 --> 10:24.040
A barrier?

10:24.123 --> 10:25.625
Who would place a barrier here?

10:25.708 --> 10:26.876
Your Royal Highness.

10:29.086 --> 10:30.338
Your Royal Highness.

10:30.421 --> 10:32.715
A priestess from Jinyowon
is inside Jeongjingak.

10:33.466 --> 10:35.801
Jin Bu-yeon,
who had brought the ice stone,

10:35.885 --> 10:37.553
was found collapsed in the building.

10:48.898 --> 10:49.774
Mu-deok.

11:06.123 --> 11:09.794
The ice stone's energy entered Jeongjingak

11:09.877 --> 11:11.879
and created a barrier.

11:13.339 --> 11:15.758
Who is inside Jeongjingak?

11:16.676 --> 11:18.594
Jang Uk and Seo Yul
are nowhere to be seen.

11:18.677 --> 11:19.970
They must be in there.

11:20.930 --> 11:22.515
Young Lady Heo is inside as well.

11:22.598 --> 11:25.101
- My dear Yun-ok!
- The Crown Prince.

11:25.184 --> 11:26.727
He is in there!

11:27.478 --> 11:30.940
- What?
- Was Beom in there as well?

11:31.023 --> 11:33.150
Where is Jin-ho?

11:34.110 --> 11:35.111
Lady Jin.

11:35.194 --> 11:36.404
Do something.

11:36.487 --> 11:39.698
The ice stone swallowed up your daughter,
so she must be in there too.

11:40.324 --> 11:42.326
We cannot be rash.

11:42.410 --> 11:45.788
We all witnessed what happened
after Bu-yeon provoked it.

11:47.081 --> 11:49.834
This is all Jinyowon's fault.

11:51.293 --> 11:53.838
You wanted to see
how powerful the ice stone was.

11:53.921 --> 11:55.714
Why are you placing the blame on us?

11:56.757 --> 11:59.301
Are you trying to pick a fight again?

11:59.385 --> 12:02.054
That is enough. The kids are in there!

12:02.138 --> 12:03.722
Yun-ok!

12:20.906 --> 12:23.159
Do you have anything to do

12:23.242 --> 12:25.995
with the barrier around Jeongjingak?

12:26.078 --> 12:27.872
What happened back at the Training Center?

12:29.165 --> 12:30.207
You see…

12:39.967 --> 12:42.303
It definitely all happened
because of Mu-deok.

12:42.386 --> 12:45.764
After all, she is the real Jin Bu-yeon,
the priestess of Jinyowon.

12:46.348 --> 12:48.267
But everyone thinks I am her.

12:48.350 --> 12:50.603
I cannot say that it was because of her.

12:50.686 --> 12:51.562
What do I do?

12:52.521 --> 12:53.856
Answer me.

12:53.939 --> 12:55.191
I…

12:56.692 --> 12:57.985
do not know.

12:58.068 --> 13:01.322
I am blind,
so I could not see what had happened.

13:01.405 --> 13:04.158
I fainted when the wind struck
and just woke up.

13:04.241 --> 13:06.160
You do not know how you came here?

13:06.243 --> 13:08.704
I do not even know where I am,

13:08.787 --> 13:11.582
so how am I to know how I came here?

13:16.003 --> 13:18.214
She does not look too well.

13:19.256 --> 13:21.926
The color has drained from her face
and she is sweating.

13:22.009 --> 13:23.594
What do you think?

13:25.387 --> 13:28.224
I think you should let her rest first,
Your Royal Highness.

13:31.685 --> 13:32.686
Let her rest.

13:34.021 --> 13:35.022
Come.

13:40.569 --> 13:41.946
She must be lying.

13:43.405 --> 13:44.698
What is she hiding?

13:44.782 --> 13:46.158
Mu-deok would know.

13:46.909 --> 13:48.577
Mu-deok, you were with her, right?

13:51.205 --> 13:52.873
How did you end up here?

13:54.124 --> 13:56.794
I was here all along.

13:59.922 --> 14:01.006
You were here?

14:02.049 --> 14:04.510
Were you not pouring tea
at the Training Center?

14:05.469 --> 14:08.889
I was, but then
I followed you here immediately.

14:08.973 --> 14:11.976
I do not know what happened back there.

14:12.935 --> 14:15.854
What is the point in asking a maid

14:16.438 --> 14:20.234
who knows nothing
but to follow her master like a puppy?

14:20.317 --> 14:21.860
Do not worry, Your Royal Highness.

14:22.361 --> 14:24.822
The best mages have gathered
for the Unanimous Assembly.

14:24.905 --> 14:27.283
This barrier will be broken in no time.

14:28.450 --> 14:30.286
Bring some tea for the Crown Prince.

14:30.369 --> 14:31.453
Yes, of course.

14:43.924 --> 14:47.344
A puppy who only follows her master.

14:47.428 --> 14:49.388
A maid who knows nothing.

14:50.931 --> 14:52.641
That is Mu-deok.

14:58.939 --> 15:00.316
Look at that.

15:00.399 --> 15:02.109
There is no water to boil.

16:01.794 --> 16:04.755
Spell-brewed tea tastes the best.

16:06.507 --> 16:07.800
It has been a while.

16:10.511 --> 16:14.974
I have finally regained my power
thanks to the ice stone.

16:24.066 --> 16:26.819
What is going on? Where am I?

16:28.570 --> 16:30.864
We did not lose it this time.

16:31.699 --> 16:33.701
We are inside the ice stone.

16:35.327 --> 16:37.204
This is the ice stone?

16:37.788 --> 16:40.958
The ice stone is not limited
in shape, size, or form.

16:41.583 --> 16:43.794
It can be water, fire,

16:43.877 --> 16:45.546
or wind.

16:49.675 --> 16:52.011
Does this mean I have the ice stone now?

16:58.976 --> 17:01.603
No one can truly own the ice stone.

17:02.980 --> 17:05.065
You only use its power.

17:05.149 --> 17:07.776
Pull and get pushed.

17:07.860 --> 17:09.903
Earn one, and lose the other.

17:09.987 --> 17:12.948
That is the burden you will have to carry.

17:13.032 --> 17:15.534
I can gladly endure that.

17:15.617 --> 17:17.202
Then try it.

17:17.286 --> 17:19.329
Overflowing power means

17:19.955 --> 17:22.666
you will not be able to control
how much of it you use.

17:23.459 --> 17:26.003
Desire rain, and you will get a flood.

17:26.837 --> 17:29.548
Desire wind, and you will get a typhoon.

17:30.507 --> 17:31.592
Try to endure it.

17:32.092 --> 17:33.302
What are you?

17:33.886 --> 17:35.512
A relic of Jinyowon?

17:36.430 --> 17:38.849
How dare a soul living off my body

17:39.767 --> 17:41.226
call me a relic?

18:09.963 --> 18:11.173
Jeongjingak?

18:17.471 --> 18:18.889
What was that?

18:20.057 --> 18:23.268
A relic from Jinyowon
that had attached itself to the ice stone?

18:29.566 --> 18:31.819
Mu-deok, what is this?

18:31.902 --> 18:34.571
The Crown Prince's teacup is chipped.

18:34.655 --> 18:36.365
I am sorry.

18:36.448 --> 18:37.533
Let me get a new one.

18:38.075 --> 18:41.411
No. I do not need
to be servile any longer.

18:41.495 --> 18:42.955
- Mu-deok.
- Yes, young master.

18:43.539 --> 18:45.958
The table is dirty. Wipe it clean.

18:46.041 --> 18:48.168
I do not hesitate to be subservient.

18:48.752 --> 18:50.337
Have I become Mu-deok to the bone?

18:56.135 --> 18:57.761
I am no longer Mu-deok.

18:57.845 --> 18:58.762
Mu-deok.

19:04.017 --> 19:06.937
We have not eaten anything all day
due to the Unanimous Assembly.

19:07.020 --> 19:08.438
Do you have any food?

19:09.106 --> 19:11.733
The sujebi we have
as a late-night snack is tasty.

19:11.817 --> 19:12.734
Can you make some?

19:19.491 --> 19:21.952
I will only be Mu-deok
until I make this dish.

19:22.661 --> 19:26.290
After this, I will no longer be her.

19:27.374 --> 19:29.710
Once I can shift souls,

19:29.793 --> 19:32.171
I can choose any body I want.

19:34.423 --> 19:35.966
I could even be the King.

19:43.640 --> 19:45.184
Or should I kill my enemy

19:45.267 --> 19:47.603
and take over his body?

19:56.778 --> 19:57.988
How distasteful.

19:59.239 --> 20:01.450
I would rather choose Park Jin.

20:11.460 --> 20:13.378
I can pick any body I want.

20:13.962 --> 20:15.505
Let me think this through.

20:16.965 --> 20:18.717
This is perfect.

20:18.800 --> 20:21.094
It would be a waste
to make sujebi with this.

20:21.178 --> 20:22.763
Should I make noodles instead?

20:22.846 --> 20:24.806
Uk prefers noodles.

20:30.562 --> 20:32.648
I do get a very faint taste of it.

20:39.404 --> 20:43.325
This will be the last meal
Mu-deok makes for her young master.

20:53.293 --> 20:54.878
- Young Master.
- Yes?

20:56.255 --> 20:59.049
I made some noodles. Go and have some.

20:59.132 --> 21:00.342
Sure.

21:04.054 --> 21:07.432
As your maid, I shall leave you now.

21:09.351 --> 21:10.519
And…

21:12.396 --> 21:14.564
this will be the end, my pupil.

21:16.275 --> 21:17.317
The end?

21:19.027 --> 21:21.071
You probably did not realize it.

21:21.822 --> 21:23.448
But we are inside the ice stone.

21:24.157 --> 21:26.326
I regained my power like I did
back at Lake Gyeongcheondaeho.

21:28.954 --> 21:30.789
I will use this ice stone to shift souls

21:31.748 --> 21:33.375
and leave this body.

21:35.377 --> 21:36.670
Are you saying

21:37.713 --> 21:39.381
you will not ever see me again?

21:39.464 --> 21:41.341
We agreed that it would be the end

21:41.925 --> 21:43.885
once I regained my power.

21:43.969 --> 21:46.847
But we agreed
to talk about our future as well.

21:53.854 --> 21:55.355
There is…

21:57.524 --> 21:58.775
no other future for us.

22:07.826 --> 22:09.870
Earn one, and lose the other.

22:09.953 --> 22:12.831
That is the burden you will have to carry.

22:14.291 --> 22:16.418
If I need to lose you to regain my power,

22:18.003 --> 22:19.421
I will bear it.

22:31.683 --> 22:33.602
- Young Master.
- Yes?

22:33.685 --> 22:35.771
I made some noodles. Go and have some.

22:36.521 --> 22:38.065
- And--
- Mu-deok.

22:38.148 --> 22:40.233
I think the barrier around Jeongjingak

22:40.317 --> 22:42.194
is actually the ice stone.

22:42.778 --> 22:43.612
What?

22:44.237 --> 22:46.698
That is not something
he should have realized.

22:48.200 --> 22:50.494
They said the ice stone
was water, fire, and wind.

22:51.036 --> 22:53.038
I think we are trapped
within a force created by wind.

22:53.914 --> 22:56.374
If we are indeed inside the ice stone,

22:56.917 --> 23:00.253
could there be a way to take the ice stone
without anyone knowing?

23:02.964 --> 23:04.174
I am not sure.

23:04.257 --> 23:05.884
After all, I have reached Chisu.

23:06.635 --> 23:08.470
Could I snatch it
like I did with the Golden Fish?

23:08.553 --> 23:11.014
Your current power cannot hold a candle

23:11.598 --> 23:12.808
to the ice stone.

23:15.102 --> 23:18.396
I wish you had regained your power
like you did at Lake Gyeongcheondaeho.

23:21.191 --> 23:22.567
You would be able to do it.

23:25.737 --> 23:27.447
What if I regained my power

23:28.115 --> 23:30.283
and took the ice stone with me?

23:32.244 --> 23:34.996
If caught, you may even be killed for it.

23:36.206 --> 23:37.415
Are you not afraid?

23:37.499 --> 23:40.210
The fact that you could run away with it

23:40.293 --> 23:42.212
is always a possibility.

23:43.171 --> 23:47.050
And I already told you
that I was going to take responsibility.

23:52.097 --> 23:53.181
However,

23:54.015 --> 23:55.559
I am still a bit afraid.

23:56.935 --> 24:01.398
I am scared that you may break our promise
and abandon me without even looking back.

24:03.483 --> 24:04.442
Master.

24:04.526 --> 24:08.238
Please do not abandon me.
If you do, I will cry a river.

24:10.991 --> 24:14.661
You say such embarrassing things
so openly.

24:15.996 --> 24:17.998
You will regret it when you look back.

24:20.333 --> 24:23.253
I can always say such things
if I endure the embarrassment.

24:23.336 --> 24:26.923
But I can never turn back time
even if I regret something.

24:28.592 --> 24:31.303
Master, endure the embarrassment

24:31.386 --> 24:32.888
and be honest with yourself.

24:32.971 --> 24:35.891
That way, you will not regret anything.

24:41.730 --> 24:44.024
- Jang Uk, I--
- Young Master Jang.

24:47.652 --> 24:48.737
I will be right there.

24:49.487 --> 24:51.573
She has the key
to the room of forbidden books.

24:51.656 --> 24:54.326
Since we are here,
I want to look up some things.

24:55.368 --> 24:56.453
Right, here.

25:02.292 --> 25:03.877
Have it all. Do not let others find out.

25:29.694 --> 25:33.281
Are you looking
for forbidden books regarding sorcery?

25:33.365 --> 25:35.492
Yes, I heard that my father stored

25:35.575 --> 25:39.037
all the sorcery books that he had gotten
from a shaman here.

25:40.830 --> 25:42.332
I want to look for them.

25:45.418 --> 25:47.420
So they were Lord Jang Gang's.

25:48.505 --> 25:49.965
I will help you.

25:50.048 --> 25:53.510
I can do it alone.
You can leave the key with me and go.

25:54.928 --> 25:57.389
My grandfather entrusted me with it.

25:57.472 --> 25:59.432
How can I trust
that you will keep it safe?

25:59.516 --> 26:03.520
You are right. I am not that trustworthy.
You can keep an eye on me.

26:21.329 --> 26:23.415
Attention, everyone.

26:24.124 --> 26:28.753
We have enough spare rooms
and food at Jeongjingak.

26:28.837 --> 26:32.257
So do not worry too much.

26:32.340 --> 26:33.425
Let us remain calm.

26:33.508 --> 26:34.634
All right?

26:43.643 --> 26:46.604
Go to Gisan and summon everyone there.

26:46.688 --> 26:49.441
We deserve some power
from the ice stone as well.

26:49.524 --> 26:50.608
Yes, master.

26:53.737 --> 26:55.947
Summon everyone who can cast spells.

26:56.031 --> 26:57.907
Even children and the elderly.

26:57.991 --> 26:59.242
- Yes, my lord.
- Yes, my lord.

27:07.167 --> 27:10.295
Summon all the mages in Cheonbugwan
to Songrim.

27:10.378 --> 27:12.922
A fight could break out
over the ice stone.

27:13.423 --> 27:14.924
We need to be prepared.

27:15.008 --> 27:16.217
Yes, Your Highness.

27:23.975 --> 27:24.851
Your Majesty.

27:24.934 --> 27:26.770
You do not look well.

27:26.853 --> 27:28.855
You should go back to the palace.

27:29.689 --> 27:32.734
I must witness it myself.

27:33.777 --> 27:35.278
Since we have the ice stone,

27:36.363 --> 27:38.281
the King's Star will appear as well.

27:53.505 --> 27:56.966
Everyone must be waiting
for Words of the Heart.

27:58.510 --> 27:59.844
Let us hurry.

28:08.395 --> 28:09.437
Master.

28:09.521 --> 28:10.897
Here is Words of the Heart.

28:10.980 --> 28:12.816
That is not the priority right now.

28:12.899 --> 28:14.692
A barrier has been created
around Jeongjingak.

28:15.276 --> 28:16.403
Pardon?

28:24.327 --> 28:26.121
Will I eventually get caught?

28:28.289 --> 28:30.333
Then I will meet my demise.

28:52.021 --> 28:53.356
It is a honey biscuit.

28:54.190 --> 28:57.068
You were barely eating. Please have some.

29:01.614 --> 29:03.283
Thank you.

29:05.160 --> 29:08.246
Were you surprised to find out
that I was the Jin family's daughter?

29:08.788 --> 29:11.750
When we first met,
I hadn't found my parents yet.

29:13.126 --> 29:14.544
This is your umbrella.

29:16.171 --> 29:18.423
I have kept it with me at all times.

29:18.506 --> 29:20.717
I thought you would recognize it
if we met again.

29:24.012 --> 29:27.140
Assistant Gwanju Jin Mu
helped you find your parents?

29:27.223 --> 29:28.224
Yes.

29:30.185 --> 29:34.439
Please do not tell him
that you and I have met in the past.

29:36.608 --> 29:38.693
If my mother hears about it,

29:38.777 --> 29:41.404
she will be heartbroken
by the things I went through.

29:43.156 --> 29:45.116
Please do not tell him.

29:46.534 --> 29:48.661
Everyone who knew her has been killed.

29:49.245 --> 29:50.663
Did she spare me on purpose?

29:53.374 --> 29:56.503
Jin Mu does not know
that we know that girl's true identity.

29:57.045 --> 29:58.296
It will be a great weakness.

29:58.797 --> 30:02.425
He must have killed them all
just to hide her identity.

30:02.509 --> 30:05.261
She will face the same fate eventually.

30:05.887 --> 30:08.640
If the Queen is planning
to shift souls with her,

30:09.224 --> 30:10.558
they brought her here to be killed.

30:10.642 --> 30:13.311
She has no idea
and is doing everything she can.

30:13.394 --> 30:15.063
He is using her.

30:16.272 --> 30:18.233
Just like how he used Naksu.

30:21.945 --> 30:24.155
So-i is a pitiful girl as well.

30:26.616 --> 30:27.784
Young Master.

30:28.368 --> 30:29.619
Did you know

30:29.702 --> 30:32.038
this umbrella fails
to fulfill its purpose?

30:34.082 --> 30:37.293
Look here. It is already torn.

30:38.962 --> 30:40.046
You are right.

30:40.129 --> 30:42.382
I was told to pay a large sum
as it is a high-quality umbrella.

30:42.465 --> 30:44.259
You must have been fooled.

30:50.473 --> 30:52.016
I am quite gullible.

30:52.934 --> 30:54.185
Is that so?

31:34.559 --> 31:36.686
The soul shifter, Master Kang,
has disappeared?

31:37.353 --> 31:40.231
After feeding on her energy,
he walked out on his own.

31:40.732 --> 31:43.234
We could not find him
anywhere in Sejukwon.

31:43.318 --> 31:46.362
Since the Unanimous Assembly
was held near the Training Center,

31:46.446 --> 31:47.655
I doubt he went there.

31:47.739 --> 31:49.657
Things have been disorderly all day long.

31:49.741 --> 31:51.451
We should have spotted him.

31:51.534 --> 31:54.787
There is one place he could hide

31:55.455 --> 31:56.831
without being seen.

31:59.542 --> 32:01.377
Inside the barrier of Jeongjingak.

32:02.462 --> 32:04.422
He could be there.

32:42.335 --> 32:43.628
A soul shifter.

32:46.589 --> 32:48.007
I am with Jin Mu.

32:52.845 --> 32:54.097
I know you.

32:54.764 --> 32:56.724
I saw you shift souls
in the Cheonbugwan Secret Room.

32:56.808 --> 32:59.102
Your soul shifted out of that old body.

33:09.821 --> 33:12.991
We are on the same side. Please spare me.

33:15.410 --> 33:17.412
I need human energy this instant.

33:17.495 --> 33:19.122
I will find someone for you.

33:19.205 --> 33:20.999
Would you not prefer feeding

33:21.082 --> 33:23.584
on a Jeongjingak mage's energy
instead of mine?

33:24.210 --> 33:25.753
Wait here,

33:25.837 --> 33:27.797
and I will lure someone in.

33:29.507 --> 33:31.592
- A mage of Jeongjingak?
- Yes.

33:31.676 --> 33:33.344
Due to a barrier,

33:33.428 --> 33:35.722
no one can leave
or enter Jeongjingak right now.

33:36.347 --> 33:38.099
A barrier?

33:53.656 --> 33:55.033
Young Lady Jin?

33:55.616 --> 33:57.285
What are you doing there?

33:57.368 --> 33:59.287
I was looking for something,

33:59.370 --> 34:01.914
but then I lost the umbrella
that I use for walking.

34:03.666 --> 34:04.917
There it is.

34:41.245 --> 34:42.538
I will spare you.

34:42.622 --> 34:45.124
Go bring more mages.

34:45.708 --> 34:46.793
Yes, right.

34:50.505 --> 34:51.964
Is Seo Yul here

34:52.673 --> 34:54.217
in Jeongjingak as well?

34:56.886 --> 34:57.804
Why do you ask?

35:01.307 --> 35:02.934
He cut me with his sword.

35:03.518 --> 35:05.103
He shall be the first person I kill.

35:06.437 --> 35:07.605
He is

35:08.481 --> 35:09.649
not here.

35:13.111 --> 35:14.487
If you refuse,

35:16.197 --> 35:17.532
I will kill you first.

35:17.615 --> 35:18.616
I will obey.

35:20.201 --> 35:22.745
There is someone here
that I would like to get rid of.

35:24.163 --> 35:25.832
I will bring her here first.

35:27.333 --> 35:29.001
Please kill her.

35:42.890 --> 35:45.184
Your snacks are not tasty.

35:45.268 --> 35:46.477
Even the noodles were bad.

35:48.020 --> 35:49.772
Since I have yet to tell Jang Uk,

35:50.356 --> 35:52.108
I will be Mu-deok for a bit longer.

35:53.151 --> 35:54.694
I am sorry.

35:55.945 --> 35:57.864
Dang-gu stashed away our leader's liquor.

36:05.621 --> 36:06.956
How does it taste?

36:08.249 --> 36:09.792
It is not bad.

36:10.376 --> 36:12.044
I wonder what they are doing outside

36:12.128 --> 36:14.672
- that they still have not resolved this.
- But still,

36:14.755 --> 36:18.217
we are surrounded by flowers,
the weather is wonderful,

36:18.301 --> 36:20.970
and it is full of energy.
This is not that bad either.

36:22.138 --> 36:23.055
Your Royal Highness.

36:23.139 --> 36:24.891
Watching flowers will bore you.

36:24.974 --> 36:26.934
Would you like to watch me
perform Hyeongong?

36:27.560 --> 36:30.146
He has some fancy techniques.

36:30.229 --> 36:31.272
Is that so?

36:32.064 --> 36:33.191
I will take a look.

36:33.774 --> 36:34.942
Yes, Your Royal Highness.

37:20.863 --> 37:21.906
What?

37:21.989 --> 37:23.783
- Beom!
- Beom.

37:24.909 --> 37:26.410
Beom, wake up.

37:26.494 --> 37:27.703
- Hey!
- Hey.

37:27.787 --> 37:29.914
Let us carry him. Beom.

37:32.458 --> 37:34.543
Your energy drained out
when you cast spells?

37:34.627 --> 37:35.461
Yes.

37:35.544 --> 37:37.755
I felt my energy draining out.

37:37.838 --> 37:38.923
It felt like

37:40.132 --> 37:42.301
my energy was draining out
like a broken vase.

37:43.177 --> 37:44.720
I examined his core of energy,

37:44.804 --> 37:46.555
and he has lost a lot of energy.

37:48.349 --> 37:49.850
How could I lose my torrent of energy?

38:00.403 --> 38:01.862
Maybe this sword is the problem.

38:19.755 --> 38:22.174
My energy just drained from the sword.

38:22.758 --> 38:24.760
I think the barrier
is causing the problem.

38:26.804 --> 38:28.764
I think it takes the energy you use…

38:30.975 --> 38:32.518
when you cast spells.

38:46.532 --> 38:48.326
We cannot use spells

38:48.409 --> 38:50.036
or unsheathe our swords in here.

38:50.828 --> 38:52.413
Let us keep our swords here.

39:01.130 --> 39:03.632
This is Naksu's sword
that Master Lee had taken from me.

39:04.175 --> 39:05.301
Did you have it?

39:05.384 --> 39:07.970
Yes, Your Royal Highness.
He wanted me to keep it safe.

39:08.054 --> 39:09.847
But Maidservant Kim
did not want it at home.

39:09.930 --> 39:11.349
So I had kept it here.

39:26.030 --> 39:27.865
Keep this with you

39:27.948 --> 39:29.617
and give it to him once he comes.

39:31.577 --> 39:34.163
I cannot leave the house
when I was entrusted with this.

39:35.289 --> 39:36.499
Maidservant Kim.

39:37.625 --> 39:38.876
So tell me.

39:38.959 --> 39:41.420
Did the Unanimous Assembly go smoothly?

39:41.504 --> 39:42.838
Not at all.

39:42.922 --> 39:46.175
All the mages from different families
are headed to Songrim.

39:47.093 --> 39:49.053
Something must have come up.

39:50.638 --> 39:53.933
He will have to show himself
with all the fuss going around.

40:01.232 --> 40:03.984
Will Gwanju Jang Gang really return?

40:28.092 --> 40:30.136
Who are you to come here?

40:33.222 --> 40:34.432
Gwanju.

40:39.437 --> 40:43.649
Who is Assistant Gwanju's right hand
at the moment?

41:08.549 --> 41:11.760
Cho Chung threatened to expose
the truth about Young Master Jang.

41:11.844 --> 41:15.097
I had no choice
but to teach him the alchemy of souls.

41:15.639 --> 41:19.101
Since he has run wild and died,
is this not the end?

41:19.935 --> 41:23.272
I only did what I did
for you and your son.

41:24.106 --> 41:27.943
I have lost my closest friend
as well as my wife to sorcery.

41:29.195 --> 41:31.280
I will get rid
of all remaining Soul Ejectors

41:31.906 --> 41:34.158
and seal the ice stone
in Lake Gyeongcheondaeho.

41:34.783 --> 41:35.910
No.

41:36.869 --> 41:39.497
After all that you have done to master it.

41:39.580 --> 41:41.457
How could you let go of the ice stone?

41:41.540 --> 41:42.666
You cannot do that.

41:44.210 --> 41:46.295
Since you also learned
the alchemy of souls,

41:47.129 --> 41:49.965
I will destroy your energy flow
so you cannot perform sorcery.

41:50.049 --> 41:51.467
Destroy my energy flow?

41:52.718 --> 41:54.178
No, my lord.

42:01.227 --> 42:04.021
Please do not destroy my energy flow.

42:04.104 --> 42:07.274
I swear I will never perform
the alchemy of souls

42:07.775 --> 42:11.111
which you have taught me. I promise!

42:29.588 --> 42:32.841
I should have destroyed his energy flow.

42:35.135 --> 42:38.347
Instead of hiding the ice stone,
I should have come clean

42:38.931 --> 42:40.849
and destroyed the ice stone.

42:43.185 --> 42:45.896
How did he retrieve the ice stone

42:47.273 --> 42:49.233
from Lake Gyeongcheondaeho?

42:50.317 --> 42:51.902
Or did someone help him?

43:23.684 --> 43:25.436
I feel the same.

43:27.146 --> 43:29.565
But there is only one thing
that makes me different.

43:30.941 --> 43:32.192
It is that…

43:34.445 --> 43:35.946
I am a soul shifter.

43:39.325 --> 43:40.659
Hey, Beom.

43:41.535 --> 43:42.911
You can always train again.

43:43.495 --> 43:46.165
He is right. You will be fine.

43:46.248 --> 43:47.458
Cheer up.

43:47.541 --> 43:50.628
The ice stone is draining their energy.

43:50.711 --> 43:53.672
If I shift souls
and take the stone's energy,

43:54.256 --> 43:56.925
will I be taking their energy as well?

43:57.635 --> 44:00.012
Earn one, and lose the other.

44:00.095 --> 44:02.848
That is the burden you will have to carry.

44:03.891 --> 44:05.726
If I want to regain my power,

44:07.853 --> 44:10.147
I will have to take their energy as well.

44:11.440 --> 44:12.358
And if I do that,

44:13.025 --> 44:14.485
they will die.

44:25.579 --> 44:27.206
I will have to take responsibility

44:28.165 --> 44:30.042
for their deaths.

44:33.796 --> 44:36.548
Filthy Mu-deok, what are you doing here?

44:42.805 --> 44:44.348
He will die as well.

44:45.140 --> 44:46.475
It is dangerous here.

44:46.558 --> 44:48.602
If someone like you touches the barrier,

44:48.686 --> 44:50.646
your bones could get crushed.

44:50.729 --> 44:52.231
Step back.

44:56.402 --> 44:58.112
Are you not going to thank me?

44:59.947 --> 45:02.241
I was showing my concern for you.

45:05.285 --> 45:07.329
You had lost your energy back there.

45:08.247 --> 45:09.540
Are you all right?

45:11.708 --> 45:14.169
Is this how you are thanking me?
Worrying about me too?

45:15.254 --> 45:16.380
Not a bad idea.

45:17.506 --> 45:19.258
I am fine.

45:20.426 --> 45:21.593
I am sorry.

45:21.677 --> 45:22.928
For what?

45:23.011 --> 45:26.515
For making terrible noodles and snacks.

45:27.057 --> 45:28.725
You could not eat anything.

45:34.356 --> 45:35.941
Please have some of this instead.

45:40.362 --> 45:41.989
Honey biscuits, Jang Uk's favorite.

45:42.489 --> 45:44.867
Are you sharing some
that you had gotten for him?

45:44.950 --> 45:47.453
Forget it. You can have them.

45:49.371 --> 45:52.374
Look. I know I should take them.

45:53.876 --> 45:57.671
But I have decided
to give them to you instead. All of those.

46:00.632 --> 46:02.259
I have given them to you.

46:03.802 --> 46:06.889
He may not be the nicest man,
but he has been very considerate.

46:10.476 --> 46:11.351
Take this.

46:11.435 --> 46:13.562
I want to thank you
from the bottom of my heart.

46:14.938 --> 46:16.899
- Your heart?
- Yes, Your Royal Highness.

46:17.566 --> 46:18.942
I mean it.

46:20.402 --> 46:22.237
I am always grateful.

46:26.658 --> 46:29.286
If you want to thank me sincerely,

46:30.120 --> 46:33.332
give me something bigger than that.

46:34.791 --> 46:36.335
I would prefer something grander.

46:43.634 --> 46:44.927
Just take this.

46:46.428 --> 46:48.347
This is just the right amount.

46:52.226 --> 46:54.144
You are unbelievable.

46:56.188 --> 46:59.149
You are always impertinent
and barge your way in.

46:59.733 --> 47:02.528
But whenever I reach for you,
you always back away.

47:05.656 --> 47:08.450
The reason why I am not persistent
in trying to hold on to you

47:09.117 --> 47:11.495
is that if you still refuse, I would…

47:16.792 --> 47:19.545
Forget it. I will not accept
if it is only that amount.

47:33.016 --> 47:35.769
I would have felt
less terrible had he taken it.

47:39.773 --> 47:40.899
Fine.

47:41.692 --> 47:44.152
I do not have to feel entirely guilty.

48:08.468 --> 48:09.303
Mu-deok.

48:12.180 --> 48:13.640
I have a favor to ask of you.

48:14.349 --> 48:16.602
Can you go to the mages' quarters for me?

48:17.894 --> 48:19.062
What for?

48:19.146 --> 48:22.149
It is humid here.
Could you bring me a new blanket?

48:23.066 --> 48:24.651
I heard you can get it there.

48:38.832 --> 48:40.042
Yes, Young Lady.

49:00.187 --> 49:01.855
What are you doing?

49:01.938 --> 49:04.066
Trying to keep
the fire in the brazier alive.

49:23.001 --> 49:24.002
Darn it.

49:24.920 --> 49:26.213
Really?

49:26.797 --> 49:28.048
Are you a moron?

49:30.717 --> 49:31.927
Wait.

49:35.013 --> 49:37.808
Did you just call me a moron?

49:37.891 --> 49:39.559
There are countless books here.

49:39.643 --> 49:41.228
You could have burned them all.

49:41.311 --> 49:43.271
I could have cast a spell to control it.

49:43.355 --> 49:44.773
I was simply flustered…

49:46.024 --> 49:47.317
as I cannot do it right now.

49:47.401 --> 49:50.779
Still, you could have
just closed the lid on it.

49:50.862 --> 49:52.572
They say you are a genius.

49:52.656 --> 49:54.574
But you do not know
what to do when flustered.

49:54.658 --> 49:57.035
- You are just a fool.
- Do not bad-mouth me.

49:57.119 --> 49:58.662
I will get upset.

50:00.497 --> 50:02.082
So you do know how to be upset.

50:03.375 --> 50:05.544
You were always so placid like water.

50:06.044 --> 50:08.797
Even water can boil or freeze.

50:09.673 --> 50:11.174
It does not always stay the same.

50:19.433 --> 50:21.852
It is humid due to the fog.

50:21.935 --> 50:24.479
Were you doing this
because your leg was hurting?

50:26.857 --> 50:29.401
You remembered.

50:30.861 --> 50:32.028
I am fine.

50:32.112 --> 50:33.280
Do not worry.

50:37.284 --> 50:39.661
You said you liked pine pollen tea snacks.

50:41.663 --> 50:43.165
But I never got to give you any.

50:44.207 --> 50:45.709
You remembered that as well.

50:47.544 --> 50:49.087
What is the point?

50:49.796 --> 50:51.548
I never got you any.

50:52.424 --> 50:54.676
Then make some for me next time.

50:57.721 --> 50:59.306
There is no next time.

50:59.389 --> 51:03.518
If I shift souls, he will die as well.

51:03.602 --> 51:04.478
Better yet,

51:04.561 --> 51:06.855
teach me the recipe.

51:06.938 --> 51:09.900
Then I can make it myself. Like last time.

51:10.567 --> 51:11.860
Do you remember?

51:19.117 --> 51:20.243
I cherish

51:21.119 --> 51:23.121
all the memories I had in Danhyanggok.

51:32.798 --> 51:35.759
Seo Yul will die.

51:40.639 --> 51:43.600
I was on my way to the quarters
for some blankets.

51:43.683 --> 51:45.060
I will get going then.

51:53.151 --> 51:56.071
Let me do that. Go to Uk.

52:05.580 --> 52:07.332
He has been looking for you.

52:19.928 --> 52:21.638
I just need to be Naksu again.

52:22.889 --> 52:25.183
I had cut ties with him back then.

52:27.227 --> 52:28.979
I will do the same with everyone.

52:42.242 --> 52:45.120
Glaring at it will not break the barrier.

52:51.710 --> 52:52.794
Did you see that?

52:53.628 --> 52:55.213
The stone passed through.

52:56.047 --> 52:57.090
You are right.

52:58.008 --> 53:00.218
Maybe only things
that have liquid cannot pass.

53:00.302 --> 53:01.803
What a strange barrier.

53:01.887 --> 53:04.764
It filters what can and cannot pass.

53:04.848 --> 53:06.308
What kind of barrier is that?

53:07.017 --> 53:08.685
What are the others doing outside?

53:08.768 --> 53:12.522
Despite all the mages out there,
they have yet to break this barrier.

53:13.940 --> 53:15.692
Is it because the ice stone made it?

53:15.775 --> 53:19.613
They are probably too busy
fighting over who gets the ice stone.

53:19.696 --> 53:22.824
Still, they know
that I am trapped in here.

53:24.451 --> 53:29.205
Perhaps you are not that important
to the Queen who has the ice stone.

53:30.665 --> 53:32.125
How could a mother be like that?

53:33.126 --> 53:35.045
Or is she similar to my father?

53:37.213 --> 53:38.715
Fine.

53:38.798 --> 53:42.469
As you all know,
she is not my biological mother.

53:43.553 --> 53:45.472
Just like you and your father.

53:47.641 --> 53:49.142
That is what everyone says.

53:49.976 --> 53:51.895
I will not apologize even if you are hurt.

53:52.604 --> 53:54.481
Then I will not beat around the bush.

53:55.190 --> 53:58.902
If the Queen and Jin Mu
offer the power of the ice stone to you,

53:58.985 --> 54:00.362
can you still get rid of them?

54:03.365 --> 54:07.661
It would be difficult
to decline such grand power.

54:08.620 --> 54:09.829
You are brave.

54:11.331 --> 54:13.959
You need the courage
to be open about your greed.

54:18.296 --> 54:21.800
And you? What will you do
if you had the ice stone?

54:25.303 --> 54:27.180
I will do what Master Seo Gyeong did.

54:27.263 --> 54:28.431
Seo Gyeong?

54:30.016 --> 54:32.769
Do you mean you wish to become
a hero with the fate of the King's Star

54:32.852 --> 54:34.771
by destroying every ice stone
and saving the world from chaos?

54:34.854 --> 54:38.441
I am sure he did
such a thing out of sincerity.

54:39.526 --> 54:42.862
But I believe he saved one stone
to save someone he loved

54:43.488 --> 54:45.115
out of sincerity as well.

54:45.615 --> 54:48.076
You see, that part touches me more.

54:51.413 --> 54:53.915
So that is what he wrote in his book.

54:53.999 --> 54:57.293
It is just a poor excuse
for not being able to let go of the stone.

54:58.086 --> 54:59.379
Who would believe that?

54:59.462 --> 55:00.839
I do.

55:02.799 --> 55:05.468
Because I would do the same.

55:23.028 --> 55:24.195
What?

55:24.279 --> 55:26.072
Stones pass through the barrier.

55:26.156 --> 55:28.616
Send a notice to urge them
to come to your rescue.

55:31.828 --> 55:32.662
Jang Uk.

55:34.122 --> 55:35.248
You are a genius.

55:39.252 --> 55:40.336
Let me see.

55:43.673 --> 55:45.842
- A barrier…
- Uk.

55:46.593 --> 55:48.428
Is there a bigger stone?

55:48.511 --> 55:50.305
They just need to read your message.

55:50.388 --> 55:52.098
You do not need a bigger one.

55:52.182 --> 55:53.683
I need to write in big letters.

55:54.392 --> 55:56.561
Does this one not budge?

55:59.439 --> 56:00.690
- Cheers.
- Cheers.

56:01.691 --> 56:04.277
By the way, why did Dang-gu never tell us

56:04.360 --> 56:06.863
about his stash of liquor?

56:06.946 --> 56:09.282
We should drink it all. Drink up.

56:09.365 --> 56:11.785
- Let us drink.
- Let us drink.

56:16.498 --> 56:17.874
I brought another brazier.

56:20.251 --> 56:21.461
Mu-deok.

56:22.045 --> 56:23.838
Why are you here?

56:23.922 --> 56:25.006
What do you mean?

56:27.008 --> 56:29.594
Young Master Seo went
to get the blankets himself.

56:32.847 --> 56:34.641
Is Seo Yul here in Jeongjingak as well?

56:34.724 --> 56:36.601
He shall be the first person I kill.

57:07.090 --> 57:09.592
Young Master Seo,
you cannot enter this room.

57:10.844 --> 57:13.179
- What is the matter?
- Please go back.

57:14.889 --> 57:17.308
Can you see me?

57:17.892 --> 57:19.435
You see, I…

57:50.383 --> 57:51.926
Young Master Seo!

58:22.373 --> 58:23.583
Young Master Seo!

58:25.543 --> 58:28.755
Young Master Seo! What do I do?

58:47.190 --> 58:48.358
What do I do?

59:12.423 --> 59:13.675
What?

59:13.758 --> 59:15.843
Who are you?

59:44.497 --> 59:45.915
Yul!

59:45.999 --> 59:46.833
Yul.

59:53.298 --> 59:55.675
- Young Master Seo!
- Are you all right?

01:00:27.457 --> 01:00:28.583
Yul.

01:00:30.251 --> 01:00:32.045
- What happened?
- A soul shifter.

01:00:32.128 --> 01:00:33.296
There is a soul shifter.

01:00:33.379 --> 01:00:34.631
What?

01:00:38.134 --> 01:00:39.469
A soul shifter is here.

01:00:39.552 --> 01:00:42.180
He fed on Yun-su and Jin-ho's energy.

01:00:57.820 --> 01:01:00.990
Master Kang of Daegangtongun,
a very powerful man, is the soul shifter.

01:01:01.074 --> 01:01:04.410
And he was using his energy
to cast spells.

01:01:04.494 --> 01:01:06.746
None of us could use spells in here.

01:01:07.413 --> 01:01:08.831
So why can he?

01:01:08.915 --> 01:01:11.292
This place drains our energy,

01:01:11.376 --> 01:01:12.835
but it must be the opposite for them.

01:01:15.797 --> 01:01:17.632
What if I regained my power

01:01:18.257 --> 01:01:20.426
and took the ice stone with me?

01:01:21.094 --> 01:01:23.846
If caught, you may even be killed for it.

01:01:25.306 --> 01:01:26.516
Are you not afraid?

01:01:26.599 --> 01:01:28.685
I am still a bit afraid.

01:01:28.768 --> 01:01:31.270
I am scared that you may break our promise

01:01:31.354 --> 01:01:33.189
and abandon me without even looking back.

01:01:35.608 --> 01:01:37.902
- Jang Uk, I--
- Young Master Jang.

01:01:42.365 --> 01:01:45.326
Where is Mu-deok?

01:01:45.910 --> 01:01:47.704
She was with us up until a while ago.

01:01:48.329 --> 01:01:49.580
Where did she go?

01:01:56.295 --> 01:01:58.172
There was a nuisance roaming around.

01:02:08.641 --> 01:02:10.977
If he is not stopped,
they will all die in there.

01:02:13.020 --> 01:02:15.898
They are going to die
once I shift souls anyway.

01:02:15.982 --> 01:02:17.900
It would be ridiculous to save them.

01:02:19.026 --> 01:02:20.903
This is how I will cut ties with them.

01:02:25.700 --> 01:02:27.952
I just feel too guilty.

01:02:28.536 --> 01:02:31.289
This will be the last time I save them.

01:02:32.206 --> 01:02:33.374
Just this once.

01:02:35.835 --> 01:02:36.919
You.

01:02:38.212 --> 01:02:40.923
- Where have you been?
- I am here, am I not?

01:02:41.424 --> 01:02:42.508
Uk…

01:02:43.134 --> 01:02:44.343
Jang Uk could die!

01:03:05.782 --> 01:03:07.575
No one can beat him here right now.

01:03:08.284 --> 01:03:09.911
We cannot all die.

01:03:09.994 --> 01:03:12.455
I will lure and trap him
in the secret room.

01:03:16.125 --> 01:03:19.128
Once he traps the soul shifter
and himself in the secret room,

01:03:19.212 --> 01:03:20.546
Uk will die.

01:03:21.088 --> 01:03:22.173
Why?

01:03:22.924 --> 01:03:24.509
Why did he go alone?

01:03:25.426 --> 01:03:27.804
He said he had to.

01:03:27.887 --> 01:03:29.305
He said he was responsible.

01:03:36.687 --> 01:03:39.273
- Where are you going?
- To the secret room.

01:03:40.650 --> 01:03:42.652
If the door to the secret room is open,

01:03:44.070 --> 01:03:46.614
that means Uk died after failing
to lure the soul shifter there.

01:03:46.697 --> 01:03:48.199
If it is closed,

01:03:49.116 --> 01:03:50.743
he is probably already dead.

01:03:51.494 --> 01:03:52.703
There is no use.

01:03:54.997 --> 01:03:57.875
You said you would not be persistent
in trying to hold on to me.

01:03:58.835 --> 01:04:00.586
You cannot stop me.

01:04:01.587 --> 01:04:02.964
So please let me go.

01:05:01.606 --> 01:05:05.192
If it is closed,
he is probably already dead.

01:05:09.530 --> 01:05:13.075
But I can never turn back time
even if I regret something.

01:05:14.535 --> 01:05:15.745
Jang Uk.

01:08:09.627 --> 01:08:11.045
You are still alive,

01:08:13.214 --> 01:08:14.632
my pupil.

01:08:33.818 --> 01:08:35.444
Why did you hide it?

01:08:39.698 --> 01:08:40.825
Because…

01:08:42.827 --> 01:08:44.078
I wanted you to die.

01:08:45.871 --> 01:08:47.039
Then…

01:08:48.290 --> 01:08:49.583
why did you come for me?

01:08:52.920 --> 01:08:54.046
Because…

01:08:58.259 --> 01:08:59.760
I thought you would die.

01:09:06.433 --> 01:09:08.185
Since you have unsheathed the sword,

01:09:09.562 --> 01:09:10.896
make your decision.

01:09:13.858 --> 01:09:15.609
I know you have been avoiding me.

01:09:15.693 --> 01:09:18.320
I also know that everyone's lives
are in your hands.

01:09:22.741 --> 01:09:24.076
Like you promised,

01:09:25.161 --> 01:09:26.745
point your sword at me first.

01:09:41.135 --> 01:09:42.178
If you stab me,

01:09:42.887 --> 01:09:45.472
then I will die as the one

01:09:46.223 --> 01:09:47.600
who released the assassin.

01:09:49.768 --> 01:09:51.061
If you withdraw your sword,

01:09:51.896 --> 01:09:53.898
I will make you another promise.

01:10:17.296 --> 01:10:18.422
Fine.

01:10:22.885 --> 01:10:24.762
Make me another promise

01:10:26.347 --> 01:10:28.182
just like you said you would.

01:11:41.505 --> 01:11:44.800
What human would choose
to give up on such immense power?

01:11:44.883 --> 01:11:47.177
To protect what we must…

01:11:47.261 --> 01:11:48.679
What if I give it all away?

01:11:48.762 --> 01:11:50.556
I am trying to protect as well.

01:11:51.307 --> 01:11:53.142
Why is he here?

01:11:53.225 --> 01:11:55.728
Jin Bu-yeon's immense divine powers

01:11:55.811 --> 01:11:57.896
not only came from her mother,
a member of the Jin family.

01:11:57.980 --> 01:12:01.275
Park Jin! You hid the truth,
despite knowing everything.

01:12:03.193 --> 01:12:07.698
Then those leaving shall leave,
and those returning shall return.

01:12:07.781 --> 01:12:10.367
Young Master. Do what you must.

01:12:10.451 --> 01:12:13.620
I will be trying something
not out of stupidity, but out of vigor.

01:12:13.704 --> 01:12:15.205
Just as my master has taught me.

01:12:15.289 --> 01:12:17.624
- I look quite nice.
- Goodness.

01:12:17.708 --> 01:12:20.044
I heard there was a bride
about to get married soon.

01:12:22.755 --> 01:12:27.760
Subtitle translation by: Soo-ji Kim
